<title>FINLAND: NOKIA OPENS AT $57-1/4 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA OPENS AT $57-1/4 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADS opened $1-1/4 lower at $57-1/4 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>The price corresponds to about 259.38 markka.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
